      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA TIANA (1) is a talented type who notched her 9th career success when too good (29.45) at this track last time. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won nine of 18 tries. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Can make it two on the bounce. HOTSHOT LILY (5) is a talented dog who is a winner of 19 races and filled a minor placing latest when third at this track (29.88). Form here at the trip excellent including eight wins. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Can feature again. SEE THIS (4) box seated before sticking on well to finish 9 lengths away in third (30.49) at Gosford in a NG over 515m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to be in this for a long way. BABY FACE BANDIT (8) has merit but will need to be at his best to take this out.",
